# pack: cqrs
# version: 1
# Commands mutate and queries read; the two sides have separate models.
R {commands} dir:commands|command|write|mutations
R {queries}  dir:queries|query|read|reads
C C:cqrs A handler mutates or reads, never both
K G cqrs.commands-mutate-only {commands} a command handler changes state and returns an acknowledgement, not a read model
K G cqrs.queries-read-only    {queries}  a query handler reads and never changes state
K G cqrs.separate-models      {queries}  {queries} never import {commands}; the read model is its own shape rule:noimport:{queries}:{commands}
K G cqrs.no-query-in-command  {commands} {commands} never import {queries}; a command validates against the write model rule:noimport:{commands}:{queries}
E {commands} impl C:cqrs
E {queries} impl C:cqrs
